{"id":"torrey:second-coming-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Second Coming Of Christ, The","slug":"second-coming-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Time of, unknown — Mt 24:36; Mr 13:32.","refs":[["Matt",24,36,24,36],["Mark",13,32,13,32]]},{"text":"Times of refreshing from the presence of the Lord. — Ac 3:19.","refs":[["Acts",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"Times of restitution of all things. — Ac 3:21; Ro 8:21.","refs":[["Acts",3,21,3,21],["Rom",8,21,8,21]]},{"text":"Last time. — 1Pe 1:5.","refs":[["1Pet",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Appearing of Jesus Christ. — 1Pe 1:7.","refs":[["1Pet",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Revelation of Jesus Christ. — 1Pe 1:13.","refs":[["1Pet",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour. — Tit 2:13.","refs":[["Titus",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Coming of the day of God. — 2Pe 3:12.","refs":[["2Pet",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Day of our Lord Jesus Christ. — 1Co 1:8.","refs":[["1Cor",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Prophets. — Da 7:13; Jude 1:14.","refs":[["Dan",7,13,7,13],["Jude",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Himself. — Mt 25:31; Joh 14:3.","refs":[["Matt",25,31,25,31],["John",14,3,14,3]]},{"text":"Apostles. — Ac 3:20; 1Ti 6:14.","refs":[["Acts",3,20,3,20],["1Tim",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"Angels. — Ac 1:10,11.","refs":[["Acts",1,10,1,10],["Acts",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Signs preceding — Mt 24:3-51.","refs":[["Matt",24,3,24,51]]},{"text":"In clouds. — Mt 24:30; 26:64; Re 1:7.","refs":[["Matt",24,30,24,30],["Matt",26,64,26,64],["Rev",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"In the glory of his Father. — Mt 16:27.","refs":[["Matt",16,27,16,27]]},{"text":"In his own glory. — Mt 25:31.","refs":[["Matt",25,31,25,31]]},{"text":"In flaming fire. — 2Th 1:8.","refs":[["2Thess",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"With power and great glory. — Mt 24:30.","refs":[["Matt",24,30,24,30]]},{"text":"As he ascended. — Ac 1:9,11.","refs":[["Acts",1,9,1,9],["Acts",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"With a shout and the voice of the Archangel. — 1Th 4:16.","refs":[["1Thess",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Accompanied by Angels. — 