o praise at — 1Pe 1:7.","refs":[["1Pet",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Scoff at. — 2Pe 3:3,4.","refs":[["2Pet",3,3,3,3],["2Pet",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Presume upon the delay of. — Mt 24:48.","refs":[["Matt",24,48,24,48]]},{"text":"Shall be surprised by. — Mt 24:37-39; 1Th 5:3; 2Pe 3:10.","refs":[["Matt",24,37,24,39],["1Thess",5,3,5,3],["2Pet",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Shall be punished at. — 2Th 1:8,9.","refs":[["2Thess",1,8,1,8],["2Thess",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"The man of sin to be destroyed at — 2Th 2:8.","refs":[["2Thess",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Mt 25:6; Lu 12:36,39; 19:12,15.","refs":[["Matt",25,6,25,6],["Luke",12,36,12,36],["Luke",12,39,12,39],["Luke",19,12,19,12],["Luke",19,15,19,15]]}],"refCount":127}
